king and recreation, catering for all tastes, stores and pharmacies, children's outdoor areas, public swimming pools, fitness room and spa center, bank branch and ATMs, parking, controlled entry to the territory.Port De La Mer is located in the developed central area of Dubai, where there are many medical and educational institutions. Jumeirah Street, the closest to the complex, connects the peninsula and the main beaches of Dubai with the rest of the city.","price":33000000,"title":"Port De La Mer","bitrix":{"id":718,"pf_id":"are.3.10100","source":null,"project_id":"La Mer","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Port De La Mer","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Meraas","project_location":"Jumeirah"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/340x252/B1mWffqXe280wS7BE6KLwCT355u0yAl125rrawr5.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/464x312/B1mWffqXe280wS7BE6KLwCT355u0yAl125rrawr5.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2406449,"lng":55.2499668},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/340x252/SY2QeilMFNQCdqZVk3pa79hrQRkhslOKptfWqw7r.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/464x312/SY2QeilMFNQCdqZVk3pa79hrQRkhslOKptfWqw7r.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/340x252/sMhFcwN8ECbRXNUbLFWZ2wl7gC609PObZMjuHmtZ.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/464x312/sMhFcwN8ECbRXNUbLFWZ2wl7gC609PObZMjuHmtZ.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/340x252/0wj253zphhtSV0y8N9l1HHbq3R1ytA2PCqAJFerw.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2438/images/2024/07/06/464x312/0wj253zphhtSV0y8N9l1HHbq3R1ytA2PCqAJFerw.webp"}],"images2":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/o